    "notes": "<p><i>Its body is not solid but a swirling vortex of starlight and dark matter, held in a draconic shape by unseen forces. Its \"scales\" are patches of starry sky. Its wings are vast, tattered curtains of nebular gases.</i></p><p><strong>Movement:</strong> DOUBLE NEAR (fly + starglide)</p>",
